- Replaced the comment block at the top of `copyStatic()` to call out
  that the curated library is intentionally not shipped.

### vercel.json
- Removed the `/library/:path*` cache header block (9 lines). /audios/
  block untouched.

### package.json
- Removed `prebuild`, `build:vercel`, `upload:library`, `check:manifest`,
