- Emptied the `SONGS` array (was 6 entries pointing at /library/audio/*).
  Kept the array as `[]` so the UI iterator doesn't break.

### versions/music_video.html
- Replaced the "Request demo files" hint that linked to /library/manifest.json
  with a plain upload-hint. DEFAULT_SONG = '../audios/film.mp3' untouched.

### Verification
- `npm run check`: ALL GREEN (same checks as before, minus the deleted ones)
- `npm run build`: success, dist/ is 66MB (was ~140MB+). dist/library/
