Stage 2 actual time: ~25 min vs 2 hour plan.


## 2026-09-13T04:15:00Z · STAGE 3 · done · hermes

Stage 3 took ~10 min (planned 30 min).

File changed: 1 (`client/library-loader.client.js`).

### Why a "stub" instead of deleting the file
13 of the 19 `versions/*.html` files call `SWR_LIBLOAD.boot(...)` from
their `_library-loader-inject.js` shim. The hook contract is load-bearing:
deleting the file would break every variant page's Media Manager boot.

The minimal fix: hoist `window.__swrPhase2Done = phase2Done` ABOVE the
early-return guard, so verify tests that race to await it don't hang on
a missing property. The phase-1/phase-2 logic stays verbatim — if the
manifest ever returns 200 again (someone re-enables the library), the
loader Just Works without any caller changes.

### Verification
- `node verify-library-loads.mjs`: 4/4 pass (test still in repo even
  though I removed it from package.json — re-add later if wanted).
- Output debug: `Lib.items=-1, Layers.list=0` — Lib never instantiates
  because the manifest 404s, which is the new expected state.
- `npm run check`: ALL GREEN.

Stage 3 actual time: ~10 min vs 30 min plan.
